    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d452">

                <pb facs="0414" n="298" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg298"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 351.117/17.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to Ambassador Herrick.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 4, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>233. Your 231, October 28. Did Chandeysson voluntarily enlist in the French Army?
                    If not, ask for release on the ground of American citizenship.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
